OL,3,GNEWSABurst main sparks flood as homes
OL,4,Aleft with no water
OL,5,
OL,6,FA burst water main on the edge of
OL,7,FBristol has caused flooding, with
OL,8,Fresidents also experiencing low water
OL,9,Fpressure or no supply.
OL,11,FBristol Water has said properties in
OL,12,Fthe BS34, BS32, BS7 and BS10 post codes
OL,13,Fare affected by the burst main between
OL,14,FHammond Road and Hayes Way in Patchway.
OL,16,FA spokesperson for the firm said work
OL,17,Fhad begun to fix the issue, adding:
OL,18,F"For properties that we are not able to
OL,19,Freroute water supplies, we are
OL,20,Fexploring options for a bottled water
OL,21,Fstation."
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
