OL,3,GNEWSABurst main sparks flood as homes
OL,4,Aleft with no water
OL,5,
OL,6,FAvon Fire and Rescue Service said it
OL,7,Fwas called to flooding in the area and
OL,8,Furged motorists to follow diversions
OL,9,Fand allow extra time for their
OL,10,Fjourneys.
